269
00:10:43,351 --> 00:10:44,311
Sure.

270
00:10:44,352 --> 00:10:47,188
Horny bitch.

271
00:10:49,816 --> 00:10:51,401
No, you're a horny bitch.

272
00:10:51,443 --> 00:10:54,779
No, you're
a horny bitch.

273
00:10:54,821 --> 00:10:57,324
No, you're
a horny bitch...

274
00:10:59,659 --> 00:11:00,619
So you guys go.

275
00:11:00,660 --> 00:11:01,786
Have a really
good time.

276
00:11:01,828 --> 00:11:03,330
Okay, I'm just going
to grab my coat.

277
00:11:03,371 --> 00:11:05,206
And, uh,
and my whip.

278
00:11:06,916 --> 00:11:08,960
You know, because
