286
00:11:37,280 --> 00:11:40,241
Are you okay with this?

287
00:11:40,283 --> 00:11:41,535
Oh, yeah.

288
00:11:41,576 --> 00:11:43,453
Yeah, please, you guys have fun.

289
00:11:43,495 --> 00:11:45,704
Okay.

290
00:11:45,746 --> 00:11:47,040
