337
00:13:35,523 --> 00:13:37,984
Well, hats off to the chef.

338
00:13:38,025 --> 00:13:39,653
I'm sorry, your mouth was full.

339
00:13:39,694 --> 00:13:41,154
I didn't hear what you said.

340
00:13:41,195 --> 00:13:42,614
Hats off to who, now?

341
00:13:42,656 --> 00:13:43,448
The chef.

342
00:13:43,490 --> 00:13:45,158
That's right.

343
00:13:47,661 --> 00:13:49,828
I think you'll find
