344
00:13:49,870 --> 00:13:51,164
that I don't micromanage.

345
00:13:51,205 --> 00:13:53,458
I don't shy away from
delegating.

346
00:13:53,500 --> 00:13:55,335
Mm-hmm, that's good to know.

347
00:13:55,376 --> 00:13:57,462
But let's stop focusing on
what you don't do

348
00:13:57,504 --> 00:13:59,589
and focus on what you do do.

349
00:14:03,009 --> 00:14:07,930
What I do do...

350
00:14:07,972 --> 00:14:11,058
is manage to create
an atmosphere of support

351
00:14:11,100 --> 00:14:13,186
for the people working with me.

352
00:14:13,227 --> 00:14:14,688
I see.

353
00:14:14,729 --> 00:14:16,105
Nice sidestep on
the do do thing, by the way.

354
00:14:16,147 --> 00:14:17,565
Hardest thing I've ever
done in my life.

355
00:14:18,692 --> 00:14:19,942
You got to go!

356
00:14:19,984 --> 00:14:21,319
Okay, don't worry.
You're ready.

357
00:14:21,361 --> 00:14:22,862
Really?

358
00:14:22,903 --> 00:14:25,281
Absolutely. Just fight all
your natural instincts

359
00:14:25,323 --> 00:14:26,866
and you'll be great.

360
00:14:29,369 --> 00:14:31,871
Ah, Monica,
my star student.

361
00:14:31,912 --> 00:14:33,956
You know, you
called me that before

362
00:14:33,998 --> 00:14:36,459
so I took the liberty of
fashioning a star

363
00:14:36,501 --> 00:14:37,711
out of aluminum foil.

364
00:14:37,752 --> 00:14:39,170
Now, no pressure.

365
00:14:39,212 --> 00:14:41,047
You like my cookies,
you give me the star.

366
00:14:43,924 --> 00:14:46,720
Mmm-mm-mm...

367
00:14:46,761 --> 00:14:49,305
Wow, a star!

368
00:14:49,347 --> 00:14:51,057
I know you all hate me

369
00:14:51,098 --> 00:14:53,309
