371
00:14:59,148 --> 00:15:01,234
Oh, my God!

372
00:15:01,275 --> 00:15:02,777
This is amazing.

373
00:15:02,819 --> 00:15:04,195
You get an A.

374
00:15:04,237 --> 00:15:08,074
I got an A? In school?

375
00:15:08,115 --> 00:15:10,034
Hey, I'm a dork!

376
00:15:10,076 --> 00:15:13,204
Joey, I'm so proud of you.

377
00:15:13,246 --> 00:15:15,540
