381
00:15:21,212 --> 00:15:22,547
Nobody knows
what they're doing.

382
00:15:22,589 --> 00:15:24,591
I do. I'm a professional chef.

383
00:15:24,632 --> 00:15:25,966
( all gasping )

384
00:15:26,008 --> 00:15:28,428
Oh, relax. It's not
a courtroom drama.

385
00:15:28,469 --> 00:15:30,430
If you're
a professional chef

386
00:15:30,471 --> 00:15:32,223
