Introduction to Cooking?

387
00:15:32,265 --> 00:15:34,100
Yeah.

388
00:15:34,141 --> 00:15:35,976
I'm sorry.

389
00:15:36,018 --> 00:15:37,771
It's just that, um...

390
00:15:37,812 --> 00:15:40,064
I cook at this
restaurant, Alesandro's

391
00:15:40,106 --> 00:15:41,775
