392
00:15:41,816 --> 00:15:43,025
Oh, Alesandro's!

393
00:15:43,067 --> 00:15:44,444
I love that place.

394
00:15:44,485 --> 00:15:45,612
You do?

395
00:15:45,653 --> 00:15:47,113
Oh, yes.
You're an excellent chef.

396
00:15:47,154 --> 00:15:48,531
As a person,
