397
00:15:48,573 --> 00:15:51,409
Oh, totally crazy,
but you like the food?

398
00:15:51,451 --> 00:15:52,952
Very much.
Okay, then.

399
00:15:52,993 --> 00:15:54,788
I don't stink.

400
00:15:54,829 --> 00:15:56,372
I'm a good chef. Okay.

401
00:15:56,414 --> 00:15:58,958
Whoa, whoa, whoa,
I don't want to go.

402
00:15:58,999 --> 00:16:00,668
I'm having fun.

403
00:16:00,710 --> 00:16:02,336
Actually, did either of you
