425
00:17:11,364 --> 00:17:12,490
Really?

426
00:17:12,532 --> 00:17:14,784
Absolutely.

427
00:17:14,826 --> 00:17:15,910
You can relax.

428
00:17:15,952 --> 00:17:17,286
You did great.

429
00:17:17,328 --> 00:17:18,579
I got to say thank you.

430
00:17:18,621 --> 00:17:19,998
I was really nervous.

431
00:17:20,039 --> 00:17:21,624
I've been told
I come on too strong

432
00:17:21,666 --> 00:17:23,209
