Duties.

436
00:17:33,594 --> 00:17:35,889
Poo.

437
00:17:37,390 --> 00:17:38,683
Poo?

438
00:17:40,727 --> 00:17:43,270
Oh, my God,
this doesn't count, okay?

439
00:17:43,312 --> 00:17:45,732
