440
00:17:45,773 --> 00:17:47,567
That was the real
Chandler Bing in there.

441
00:17:47,608 --> 00:17:49,569
This is just some
crazy guy out in the hall.

442
00:17:49,610 --> 00:17:51,029
Call security!

443
00:17:51,070 --> 00:17:53,489
There's a crazy guy
out in the hall!

444
00:17:53,531 --> 00:17:55,449
Poo?

445
00:17:56,701 --> 00:17:59,037
