451
00:18:14,427 --> 00:18:15,595
Uh, it was fun.

452
00:18:15,636 --> 00:18:17,764
We just had coffee.

453
00:18:17,805 --> 00:18:19,390
Oh, uh-huh, uh-huh.

454
00:18:19,432 --> 00:18:22,602
