465
00:18:47,919 --> 00:18:49,378
Why? What was wrong with her?

466
00:18:49,420 --> 00:18:52,590
There was nothing
wrong with her, all right?

467
00:18:52,632 --> 00:18:54,634
She was perfectly
lovely.

468
00:18:54,675 --> 00:18:55,802
