484
00:19:31,712 --> 00:19:36,801
I'll be here with you,
all the time.

485
00:19:36,843 --> 00:19:40,054
Really?

486
00:19:40,096 --> 00:19:43,724
But I'm being
so unreasonable.

487
00:19:43,766 --> 00:19:48,521
True, but you're allowed
to be unreasonable.

488
00:19:48,562 --> 00:19:51,190
