489
00:19:53,567 --> 00:19:55,194
Oh...

490
00:19:55,235 --> 00:19:57,905
Ross, thank you, thank you.

491
00:20:02,118 --> 00:20:03,744
You feel better?

492
00:20:03,786 --> 00:20:06,372
No, not really.

493
00:20:06,413 --> 00:20:08,833
You're pressing the baby
into my bladder

494
00:20:08,875 --> 00:20:10,376
and now I have to pee.

495
00:20:10,417 --> 00:20:13,004
Sorry.

496
00:20:13,046 --> 00:20:14,047
Uh, Rach?

497
00:20:14,088 --> 00:20:15,214
Yeah?

498
00:20:15,255 --> 00:20:16,716
Just one thing.

499
00:20:16,757 --> 00:20:20,761
We live together,
you're having our baby...

500
00:20:20,803 --> 00:20:23,556
I'm not going to see
anybody else.

501
00:20:23,597 --> 00:20:26,976
Are you sure you don't want
something more?

502
00:20:29,478 --> 00:20:32,106
Wow.

503
00:20:32,148 --> 00:20:34,067
I don't know. Maybe.

504
00:20:34,108 --> 00:20:36,777
Rach, I was just messing around.

505
00:20:38,946 --> 00:20:41,115
Like you did last night
when I had to pee.

506
00:20:41,157 --> 00:20:43,826
I knew that, I knew that.

507
00:20:43,868 --> 00:20:45,703
I was just
messing with you, too.

508
00:20:49,331 --> 00:20:52,126
Okay, okay, because
for a minute you seemed...

509
00:20:52,168 --> 00:20:54,461
No, no, no, no!

510
00:20:54,503 --> 00:20:57,131
That's just 'cause
I'm such a good messer.

511
00:20:57,173 --> 00:20:58,507
( laughs )

512
00:21:04,680 --> 00:21:06,057
Rach?
Yeah?

513
00:21:06,099 --> 00:21:06,766
The bathroom?

514
00:21:06,807 --> 00:21:07,433
Right.

515
00:21:12,605 --> 00:21:14,356
I had a great time.

516
00:21:14,398 --> 00:21:15,733
Learned how to bake,
ate great food.

517
00:21:15,775 --> 00:21:17,860
It's the first A I've gotten
since seventh grade

518
00:21:17,902 --> 00:21:20,362
and I didn't have to sleep
with the teacher this time.

519
00:21:21,614 --> 00:21:24,825
Oh, look,
acting for beginners.

520
00:21:24,867 --> 00:21:26,660
Hey, want to feel good
about yourself?

521
00:21:26,702 --> 00:21:27,661
What the hell.

522
00:21:27,703 --> 00:21:29,580
Okay.

523
00:21:29,622 --> 00:21:31,415
All right, let's start
with some basics.

524
00:21:31,457 --> 00:21:33,709
Can anybody tell me
what the difference

525
00:21:33,751 --> 00:21:37,337
between upstage
and downstage is?

526
00:21:42,927 --> 00:21:45,138
Yeah, this was
a stupid idea.

527
00:21:45,179 --> 00:21:47,306
